    "body": "Thank you for the report. We could not reproduce the red suite on the current `main`.\n\n- On a Windows checkout, on a merge of `main` at `79cf28630` with one open PR that does not change the suite or `crates/sim/src/verify`: `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test docs_troubleshooting` gives 1 passed, 0 failed (`troubleshooting_messages_still_exist_in_the_sources`).\n- The post-merge run of `main` at `f35202134` is green. That run includes this suite.\n\nTo find the difference, please tell us:\n\n1. The commit of `main` that your branch is on (`git merge-base HEAD origin/main`).\n2. The failure output: the message stem that the test did not find, and the file that it names.\n\nA possible cause: your base is a commit between two merges of this night (for example after #3599, which added messages in `crates/sim/src/verify`, and before a later merge). If the stem is in a string that continues on the next line, the test must join the lines before it searches. That change is small, and we do it when we know the stem.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
