    "body": "New fact for this issue, from a read of the code for #3553 (not run): `crates/app/tests/docs_troubleshooting.rs:26` joins strings that continue on the next line with a backslash, and it reads the `.rs` sources as they are on disk. `.gitattributes` does not pin `crates/*/src/**/*.rs` to LF. So on a checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` the join sees `\\\\r\\n` and does not match: this explains your red suite, and why it is green on an LF checkout and on the runners. The fix is in the reader of the test (take CR out before the join); the `.rs` files cannot be pinned in one step, because seven of them hold real CR bytes. This issue is now confirmed and stays `P2`; a worker takes it.",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
