    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T08:30:15Z",
    "body": "fix on issue/3619-troubleshooting-crlf · PR #3664 · pinned by `join_continuations_accepts_crlf_line_ends` · merges when reviewed\n\nThank you for the report. The cause is the line end: on a CRLF checkout the test did not join the strings that continue with a backslash. The reader of the test now converts CRLF to LF first. The change is in the test only.\n\nPlease run this command on the branch `issue/3619-troubleshooting-crlf`, on your CRLF checkout:\n\n`cargo test -p camcraft-app --test docs_troubleshooting`\n\nPlease tell us the result.\n",
